          "purpose": "Make autoharness --list metadata-only before GOTO linking and preserve Kani-parsed requires/ensures/modifies clauses inside the single existing kanitool::checked_with string value. The first segment remains Kani's generated check-closure identity; reserved ASCII-delimiter-separated kverus_contract_clause payloads are decoded only for ContractedFunction metadata. Clause payloads containing the reserved delimiter are rejected. Contract metadata generation currently asserts that every compiler-recognized contracted function carries at least one transported clause and prints the raw checked_with value on violation. A temporary automatic-harness probe reports the raw checked_with payload and decoded clauses for contracted_* fixture functions before metadata serialization.",
